keywords:
  - addressing
  - Senegal
  - digital addresses
  - place names
  - geocoding
  - building footprints
abstract: >-
  An addressing model, reference engine and issued registry for Senegal: every
  compound has a remembered address made of a place word people already use and
  a short number ("Ouakam 2512"), unique nationally without context, with a
  machine form carrying an ISO/IEC 7064 MOD 11-2 check letter and an offline
  spot-code grid for places without a compound.
